	(text "Low pass filter fc = 1 / (2 pi (RV4 + blend source) C40) = 27 kHz...34 Hz\nIf you want to wire the filter as a pot you intend to control, find an log\ntaper one because the linear ones will have a really small usable range (fine for trim)\nVolume pot works okay as linear, but log is better!"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 174.498 93.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "19b70bca-1ff0-4cde-9ec6-97576fdaa175")
	)
